  "prefLabel": "Pub 201.17 Filing Fee",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pub 201.17 Filing Fee. All unfair labor practice complaints shall be accompanied by a filing fee as provided in RSA 273-A:6. Complaints shall not be deemed filed until the board receives the filing fee.\n\nSource. #9441-B, eff 3-27-09; ss by #12378-A, eff 9-13-17",
